          ],
          "sectionId": 16460
        }
      ],
      "title": "春和景明后篇·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16470001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "吹泡泡大赛现场——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu~吹泡泡大赛要开始了哟~还没有报名的大家要抓紧哟~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "等等等等！！！呼，呼……绿子，不要跑那么快啦！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "吹泡泡而已，我是绝对不会输给艾里克希娅的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "还是这么风风火火啊，绿子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "啊……会，会，会长……会长也来玩，玩吹泡泡吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "嗯，领悟以柔克刚，也是武道精进的重要环节。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "这样啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，吹出最大最持久的泡泡就算胜利喔，\n好了，各就位，预备——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呵………………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好长一口气！那是蓄力准备吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "噢，你说葵吗，打哈欠而已，她总是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "说起来……泡泡到底是用手还是用吹的？\n欸，海伦好厉害！那是魔法吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "一个经常和小雪人玩的小把戏，泡泡和冰雪很相近呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我要开始咯，你可别输的太惨！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "那你未免太小看专业歌手的换气功力了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470018",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈哈，哈哈哈~砰，砰，砰！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈莉！！！我好不容易维持住的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "加油。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，两位，你们出局了哟，请到旁边的美食区等待~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈欠……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "这种时候就不要犯困了，打起精神啊，葵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣……阿秋——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470026",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，向日葵出局！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，艾里克希娅出局！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，绿子出局！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470030",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "十分钟后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈欠……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好厉害，已经维持十分钟了！\n欸你们说，龙马会长和海伦，谁会赢呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470033",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "当然是会长大人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾里克希娅",
          "text": "你有私心哟？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "什，什么啊，会长大人可是最强的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这就是武道吗？好厉害！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "当然，超厉害的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470038",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "biubiu，优胜者诞生了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16470040",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "小男孩",
          "text": "恭喜仓田龙马！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-354",
